{{tsh|tlsx}}
{{tlx|tlxs|template|first parameter|second|third|fourth|fifth|sixth|seventh|eight|ninth}} → {{tlxs|template|first parameter|second|third|fourth|fifth|sixth|seventh|eight|ninth}}
;Purpose: Similar to {{tlx|tlx}} but for templates which should be [[Manual:Substitution|substituted]] instead.

Up to six parameters for the specified template are displayed as placeholders, more parameters are shown as "<code>|</code>''...''".

== Usage ==
 <nowiki>{{tlxs|</nowiki>{{var|template name}}|{{var|params ...}}<nowiki>}}</nowiki>

